#. Tag: title
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kartesio is a program for calculating best fit curves with experimental "
"points using regression algorithms or neural networks."
msgstr ""
"Kartesio je program koji računa najbolje uklapajuće krive sa "
"eksperimentalnim tačkama koristeći regresivne algoritme ili neuralne mreže."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kartesio has a simple interface that allows you to plot points and a curve. "
"The curve can be calculated by the program or you can also write it by "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Kartesio ima jednostavan interfejs koji Vam dopušta crtanje tačaka i krive. "
"Kriva može izračunati program, ali je možete i sami napisati."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "This package is part of the official KDE edutainment module."
msgstr "Ovaj paket je dio oficijelnog KDE edukaciono-zabavnog modula."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
