#. Tag: para
#: man-kartesio.1.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink url=\"help:/"
"kartesio\">help:/kartesio</ulink> (either enter this <acronym>URL</acronym> "
"into &konqueror;, or run <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kartesio</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentacija sa dodatnim detaljima je dostupna na stranici <ulink url="
"\"help:/kartesio\">help:/kartesio</ulink> (ili ukucajte ovo <acronym>URL</"
"acronym> u &konqueror;, ili pokrenite <userinput><command>khelpcenter</"
"command> <parameter>help:/kartesio</parameter></userinput>)."

